      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I personally think it would be a great idea for a messaging system in vrchat as it is already difficult for players to communicate, especially if the instance is already full. \n\nHaving to constantly invite or join someone is a hassle, especially if you don't want to leave someone else behind. \n\nMany people in vrchat have multiple different friend groups/ relationships and I think it would be appropriate for them to be able to communicate without having to join the instance that they are in.\n\nFor example: if you want someone to join you but you don't want to nag them by inviting them a bunch, you could just message them instead and ask if they would like to join. I think it would be much easier to message someone than to invite them. \n\nAnother example would be if your friend is in a server but it is full and you just want to chat or ask them something you can't join because the server's full so messaging them would be far more convenient. This is another reason why I think vrchat should implement a direct messaging system \n\nThank you for taking the time to read my comment. Yours truly, VRC USER: main: Leo_TheLegend, alt: Proto_Prodigy14",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
